ma and Lambda are used to represent the covariance matrix. This could be clarified for better consistency.","subdimension_id":"CLAR-NOT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-036","SRC-037"],"review_text":"The tables are well-labeled and provide clear information. The use of arrows to indicate statistical significance is helpful. However, the caption for Table 1 could be more detailed in explaining the significance of the arrows. The figures are referenced but their content is not described in detail in the text, which could be improved for better clarity.","subdimension_id":"CLAR-FIG"}]},"disposition":"CANONICAL_FULL_REVIEW_COMMITTED","item_commit_sha256":"d15dacb1362d1f291cd69a19bbb692e83b27ac6e37aba7c3ecde1de76d000d54","paper_id":"ByqiJIqxg","paper_ordinal":80,"raw_attempts":[{"assistant_content_base64":"","assistant_content_sha256":"6eb7edb607e11dc80203782f92cb0170630c7e4fca4a62407215e70e26651098","attempt_index":0,"error":"","finish_reason":"stop","paper_id":"ByqiJIqxg","raw_provider_response_base64":"","raw_provider_response_sha256":"800b9972b1a253b7503b37bb57469ac0781355752527ff7f2b31c62ba3df9e02","request_identity_sha256":"fab83e023b469e86f24989e19019cd76a9b798be0d20160c432cfaed1a99ff79","role":"CLAR","schema_version":"no-memory-full-review-corpus-build-v5","usage":{"completion_tokens":465,"prompt_tokens":18827,"prompt_tokens_details":null,"total_tokens":19292},"valid":true}],"request_identity_sha256":"fab83e023b469e86f24989e19019cd76a9b798be0d20160c432cfaed1a99ff79","role":"CLAR","role_ordinal":1,"schema_version":"corpus-build-bootstrap-checkpoint-v4"}